        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 130747,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mari kita lihat object. Untuk mulai mendefinisikan object, kita menggunakan kurung kurawal <code>{</code> dan <code>}</code>. Kamu sudah mengenal ini dari JavaScript.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" person: { };\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>{</code>, diikuti oleh <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5 - Copy",
            "id": 130798,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita mendefinisikan atribut di dalam objek seperti saat sebelumnya kita mendefinisikan tipe. Mulailah dengan nama, diikuti titik dua dan tipenya.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" person: {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"number\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>name</code>, diikuti oleh <code>:</code>, dan terakhir <code>string</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5 - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 130799,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita memisahkan beberapa atribut dengan koma.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" person: {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" age: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&amp;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>,</code>, diikuti oleh <code>age: number</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5 - Copy",
            "id": 130797,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sejauh ini, kita telah menentukan tipe objek. Sekarang, kita dapat menetapkan sebuah nilai.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" person: {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" age: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"person = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"&quot;John&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" age: \" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(person.name, person.age);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"82\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"John 25\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>=</code>, diikuti oleh <code>{</code>, lalu <code>name: \"John\",</code>, <code>age: 25</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 130748,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Setelah mendefinisikan sebuah objek, kita dapat berinteraksi dengannya seperti saat menggunakan JavaScript. Misalnya, kita dapat mengakses properti objek.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" person: {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" age: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"person = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"&quot;John&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" age: \" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" personName: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\" = person.name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(personName);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"116\" endIndex=\"117\" /><option startIndex=\"117\" endIndex=\"121\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;John&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"John\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>.</code>, diikuti oleh <code>name</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 130749,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Demikian pula, kamu juga bisa mengubah properti object. Coba ubah properti <code>name</code> dari object <code>person</code> menjadi \"Jane\".</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" person: {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" age: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"person = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"&quot;John&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" age: \" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"person.name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jane&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(person.name);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"98\" /><option startIndex=\"99\" endIndex=\"105\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Jane\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>person</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.</code>, lalu <code>name</code>, <code>=</code>, <code>\"Jane\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 130750,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita juga bisa memiliki tipe yang lebih kompleks di dalam sebuah object. Mari tambahkan array berisi angka.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player: {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" scores: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"[]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"string\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>number</code>, diikuti oleh <code>[]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8 - Copy",
            "id": 131282,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tentu saja, dengan object, kita juga bisa langsung menetapkan sebuah nilai.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player: {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" scores: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"[]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" scores: [\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player.scores);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"is\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[1, 2, 3]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8 - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 131283,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jika kita langsung menetapkan sebuah nilai, TypeScript akan menginferensikan tipenya. Inferensi tipe juga berfungsi untuk tipe yang lebih kompleks seperti tipe object kita.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" scores: [\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player.scores);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[1, 2, 3]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 130751,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Saat mengakses array dari sebuah object, kamu juga bisa menyimpannya dalam variabel.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player: {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" scores: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"[]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" scores: [\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scores: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"[] = player.scores;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(scores);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"129\" endIndex=\"135\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[1, 2, 3]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>scores</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8 - Copy",
            "id": 130802,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sebuah atribut dalam objek kita dapat menyimpan beberapa tipe yang berbeda. Coba dukung tipe <code>number</code> dan <code>string</code> untuk atribut <code>content</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" message: {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" content: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\" | \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"message = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" content: \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(message.content);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&amp;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"||\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>|</code>, diikuti oleh <code>number</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7 - Copy",
            "id": 130774,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lengkapi tipe objek.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" game: {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" players: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"game = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"&quot;Chess&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" players: \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(game.name, game.players);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"number\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"11\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Chess 2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>{</code>, diikuti oleh <code>string</code>, lalu <code>players</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 130801,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bisakah kita menggunakan union type untuk atribut dalam sebuah objek di TypeScript?<br /><br /></p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ya, atribut dapat memiliki union type</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Tidak, atribut hanya dapat memiliki satu tipe</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ya, atribut dapat memiliki union type.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6 - Copy",
            "id": 130776,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mengakses <code>year</code> dari objek <code>car</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" car: {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" brand: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" year: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"car = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" brand: \" /><text value=\"&quot;Porsche&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" year: \" /><text value=\"1972\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" year: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\" = car.year;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(year);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"107\" endIndex=\"110\" /><option startIndex=\"110\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option startIndex=\"111\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"brand\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1972\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>car</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.</code>, dan terakhir <code>year</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
